ll,"flags":[],"pdf":228,"printed":218,"raw":"218","seq":false}],"see":[],"source_pdf":779,"sub":"compétence"},{"article_ref":null,"label_heading":"Questionnaire (organisation)","id":"en.0166.01","lang":"en","qualifier":"competence","raw":"Questionnaire (organisation) 101, 114/5; (competence) 204, 218.","refs":[{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":214,"printed":204,"raw":"204","seq":false},{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":228,"printed":218,"raw":"218","seq":false}],"see":[],"source_pdf":785,"sub":"(competence)"}],"id":"t.questionnaire.competence","label_en":"(competence)","label_fr":"compétence","n_pages":2,"pages":[214,228],"parent":"t.questionnaire","printed_en_id":"en.0166.01","printed_fr_id":"fr.0166.02","see":[],"type":"sub"}],"groups":[{"meeting":9,"section":"9","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0214.06","meeting":9,"doc":"minutes","pdf":214,"printed":204,"texts":{"fr":"Le Président passe à la question à l'ordre du jour: la compétence de la Cour. Il a formulé le programme de quelques questions sur la matière afin d'aider le Comité à arriver à un résultat. Il donne lecture du questionnaire (voir Annexe 1). Il propose qu'on procède à la discussion du premier point: „La Cour constituera-t-elle essentiellement une juridiction entre Etats, ou sa compétence s'étendra-t-elle à des litiges concernant des p…","en":"The President now proceeded to deal with the question on the agenda, namely: the competence of the Court. He had formulated a programme for some questions on the subject in order to aid the Committee to come to a conclusion. He read this questionnaire (see Annex 1). He now proposed that they should…","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0214.06","speaker_id":"descamps","certain":true,"name":"Baron Édouard Descamps","role":"member"},"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.jurisdiction-in-the-questionnaire","weight":1.0,"end":76,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":1323,"start":52}]},{"seg_id":"s0228.04","meeting":9,"doc":"annex","pdf":228,"printed":218,"texts":{"fr":"I. La Cour constituera-t-elle essentiellement une jurisdiction entre Etats, ou sa compétence s'étendra-t-elle à des litiges concernant des particuliers? Dans quelles conditions ce dernier cas pourrait-il éventuellement se produire?","en":"I. Shall the Court constitute essentially a jurisdiction between States, or shall its competence extend to litigation concerning individuals? Under what conditions can the latter eventuality occur?","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.jurisdiction-in-the-questionnaire","weight":1.0,"end":74,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":1441,"start":3}]},{"seg_id":"s0228.05","meeting":9,"doc":"annex","pdf":228,"printed":218,"texts":{"fr":"II. Quels seront les Etats qui pourront procéder devant la Cour?","en":"II. What States may appear before the Court?","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.jurisdiction-in-the-questionnaire","weight":1.0,"end":63,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":1444,"start":4}]},{"seg_id":"s0228.06","meeting":9,"doc":"annex","pdf":228,"printed":218,"texts":{"fr":"III. Faudra-t-il l'accord des deux parties pour procéder juridictionnellement, ou l'action en justice pourra-t-elle être exercée unilatéralement par un Etat contre un autre?","en":"III. Shall the consent of the two parties be necessary to undertake judicial proceedings, or may an action in law be brought uni-laterally by one State against another?","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.jurisdiction-in-the-questionnaire","weight":1.0,"end":77,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":1447,"start":5}]},{"seg_id":"s0228.07","meeting":9,"doc":"annex","pdf":228,"printed":218,"texts":{"fr":"IV. Dans quelle mesure la judicature obligatoire peut-elle être admise?","en":"IV. To what extent may obligatory jurisdiction be admitted?","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.jurisdiction-in-the-qu